{
  "file_id": "3554",
  "format": "etdf",
  "kind": "ETDF",
  "text_count": 163,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "We made it to Myotismon's castle,\nbut it's gonna be hard to get us\nall in there.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19576,
      "_bytes": 79,
      "translation": "Hemos llegado al castillo de\nMyotismon, pero será difícil que\nentremos todos ahí."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "It doesn't seem like we'll be able\nto sneak in without being noticed.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19656,
      "_bytes": 69,
      "translation": "No parece que podamos colarnos\nsin que nos vean."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "So then what are we gonna do?",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19726,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "Entonces, ¿qué hacemos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19756,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Leave it to me!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19760,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Dejádmelo a mí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Agumon...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19776,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "Agumon..."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "The castle's full of Digimon, so I\ncan sneak in if I go by myself!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19786,
      "_bytes": 66,
      "translation": "¡Hay Digimon por todo el castillo,\nasí que puedo colarme yo solo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "If we can infiltrate Myotismon's\narmy, it may work out!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19853,
      "_bytes": 54,
      "translation": "¡Si nos infiltramos en su\nejército, podría funcionar!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "I'm worried about Agumon going in\nthere alone, so I'm going in, too!",
      "speaker_id": 2521,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19908,
      "_bytes": 68,
      "translation": "¡Me preocupa que Agumon entre\nsolo ahí, así que yo también voy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Are they gonna be okay?",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19977,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¿Estarán bien?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Leave it to me! I may not look the\npart, but I'm pretty confident in\nmy acting skills!",
      "speaker_id": 2521,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20001,
      "_bytes": 86,
      "translation": "¡Dejádmelo a mí! ¡No lo parezco,\npero se me da genial actuar!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Got it! If you find someplace you\nthink we can sneak in through,\ncome back here!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20088,
      "_bytes": 80,
      "translation": "¡Entendido! ¡Si encontráis un sitio\npor donde colarnos, volved\naquí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Okay! Wait for us!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20169,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¡Vale! ¡Esperadnos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Are they gonna be okay?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20188,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¿Estarán bien?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Recruiting Soldiers",
      "speaker_id": 9003,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20212,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "Reclutando soldados"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "I don't know how many they must\nhave gathered by now, but it's\nbetter to be safe than sorry.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20232,
      "_bytes": 92,
      "translation": "No sé cuántos habrán reunido\nya, pero más vale prevenir\nque curar."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "*sigh* They're a bunch of useless\ngrunts.",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20325,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "Uf... Menudos soldados\ninútiles."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "No need to worry! I'll train 'em\nreal hard!",
      "speaker_id": 4291,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20367,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "¡Tranquilo! ¡Los entrenaré a\nbase de bien!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "I'm counting on you. Considering\nyour experience, you're the only\nsuitable teacher around here.",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20411,
      "_bytes": 95,
      "translation": "Cuento contigo. Con tu\nexperiencia, eres el único\nprofesor adecuado por aquí."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Indeed!",
      "speaker_id": 4291,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20507,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡Así es!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "All right then, I'll leave them in\nyour hands!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20515,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "¡Muy bien, entonces los dejo\nen tus manos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Hey, is it true you're recruiting\nsoldiers?",
      "speaker_id": 2521,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20562,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "Oye, ¿es verdad que buscáis\nsoldados?"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Can we join?",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20606,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¿Nos unimos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Hmm. They might be better than\nthis lot. Okay, get over here!",
      "speaker_id": 4291,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20619,
      "_bytes": 61,
      "translation": "Hmm. Puede que seáis mejores\nque estos. ¡Vale, venid aquí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Okay, fresh meat, first you'll be\nrunning 100 laps! After that, 500\nbunny hops!",
      "speaker_id": 4291,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20681,
      "_bytes": 79,
      "translation": "¡Bien, carne fresca, primero\ndaréis 100 vueltas! ¡Después,\n500 saltos de rana!"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "What are we gonna do....",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20761,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "¿Qué hacemos...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "At this rate, it desn't look like\nwe'll have a chance to get the\nothers inside.",
      "speaker_id": 2521,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20786,
      "_bytes": 79,
      "translation": "Así, no parece que vayamos a\ntener ocasión de meter a los\notros dentro."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "We have to do something about\nNanimon.",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20866,
      "_bytes": 38,
      "translation": "Tenemos que hacer algo con\nNanimon."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Hey, I was in a unit with him\nonce.",
      "speaker_id": 4101,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20905,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "Oye, yo estuve en su unidad\nuna vez."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "...Tell us more.",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20941,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "...Cuéntanos más."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "He kept getting drunk off alcohol,\nso he was completely useless in\nreal combat.",
      "speaker_id": 4101,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20958,
      "_bytes": 79,
      "translation": "Siempre estaba borracho, así\nque era un inútil total en\ncombate real."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "So he's a heavy drinker.",
      "speaker_id": 2521,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21038,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "Así que bebe mucho."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "That might be what we need!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21063,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¡Eso puede que nos sirva!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "...?",
      "speaker_id": 2521,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21091,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Lord Myotismon, I am pleased to\nreport that we have gathered a\nmultitude of soldiers.",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21096,
      "_bytes": 84,
      "translation": "Amo Myotismon, me complace\ninformar de que hemos reunido\na multitud de soldados."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Are they of use to us?",
      "speaker_id": 3031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21181,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "¿Nos sirven de algo?"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "P-Probably...",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21204,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "P-Puede..."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Ahahaha...",
      "speaker_id": 9002,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21218,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "Ajajaja..."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Can you even call them soldiers?\nAre you trying to make a B-team or\nsomething?",
      "speaker_id": 2831,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21229,
      "_bytes": 78,
      "translation": "¿Se les puede llamar soldados?\n¿Estáis montando un equipo de\nsegunda o qué?"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Ugh, if you keep talking like\nthat, I'm gonna...",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21308,
      "_bytes": 48,
      "translation": "Uf, como sigas hablando así,\nvoy a..."
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "What? You wanna go?",
      "speaker_id": 2831,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21357,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¿Qué? ¿Quieres pelea?"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Stop. Anyway, Tailmon, did you\nfind anyone useful?",
      "speaker_id": 3031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21377,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "Basta. Bueno, Gatomon,\n¿encontraste a alguien útil?"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Yes, as instructed. I've traveled\naround and scouted a number of\nrespected veterans.",
      "speaker_id": 2831,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21428,
      "_bytes": 84,
      "translation": "Sí, tal y como se me ordenó.\nHe viajado y reclutado a varios\nveteranos respetados."
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "I look forward to meeting them.",
      "speaker_id": 3031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21513,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "Tengo ganas de conocerlos."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Yes, sir!",
      "speaker_id": 2831,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21545,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Sí, señor!"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Hahaha!",
      "speaker_id": 3031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21555,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡Jajaja!"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Are they still in there?!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21563,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¡¿Siguen ahí dentro?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "I'm getting impatient.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21589,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "Me estoy impacientando."
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Hm?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21612,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "¿Hm?"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Sorry to keep you waiting!",
      "speaker_id": 2521,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21616,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¡Siento la espera!"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Palmon! You made it!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21643,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¡Palmon! ¡Lo lograste!"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "You did it!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21664,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Bien hecho!"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Just a second! Poison Ivy!",
      "speaker_id": 2521,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21676,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¡Espera! ¡Hiedra Venenosa!"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Grab onto the vines and get in\nhere!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21703,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "¡Agarraos a las lianas y entrad\naquí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Okay! ...gh!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21740,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¡Vale! ...¡gh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Is this gonna hold?",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21753,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¿Esto aguantará?"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "It'll be fine, hurry! We're in a\nbit of a tight situation here!",
      "speaker_id": 2521,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21773,
      "_bytes": 63,
      "translation": "¡Irá bien, daos prisa! ¡Aquí\nestamos en un buen aprieto!"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "O-okay ...ughh!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21837,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡V-vale ...uugh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Whew, we got everyone in. I'm\ntired...",
      "speaker_id": 2521,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21853,
      "_bytes": 38,
      "translation": "Uf, ya entramos todos.\nEstoy agotada..."
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "So this is how we do it!\nAll right, let's head in!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21892,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "¡Así que es así como se hace!\n¡Venga, entremos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21943,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Sí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "This is a huge castle...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21949,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "Vaya castillo enorme..."
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Yeah, and there might be some\ntraps around here. Be careful.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21974,
      "_bytes": 60,
      "translation": "Sí, y puede que haya trampas\npor aquí. Tened cuidado."
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "All right, I'll go check it out!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22035,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "¡Vale, voy a echar un vistazo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "You go first, Matt.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22068,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "Ve tú primero, Matt."
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "All right, I'll go check it out!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22090,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "¡Vale, voy a echar un vistazo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "No, I'll go!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22123,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¡No, voy yo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Matt...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22136,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "Matt..."
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Tai, if you take the lead,\nwe'll all get caught in some trap.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22146,
      "_bytes": 64,
      "translation": "Tai, si tú vas delante,\ncaeremos todos en alguna trampa."
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Ahahaha!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22211,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "¡Ajajaja!"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Don't you start laughing too,\nAgumon!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22220,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "¡No te rías tú también,\nAgumon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "You go first, Matt.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22258,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "Ve tú primero, Matt."
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "What?! Matt, are you okay with\nthis?",
      "speaker_id": 2221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22280,
      "_bytes": 38,
      "translation": "¡¿Qué?! Matt, ¿te parece bien\nesto?"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Matt will do a better job of\nbeing careful around Myotismon's\nminions.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22319,
      "_bytes": 71,
      "translation": "A Matt se le da mejor tener\ncuidado con los secuaces de\nMyotismon."
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "We're all good and bad at\ndifferent things. Tai knows his\nstrengths and weaknesses, right?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22391,
      "_bytes": 93,
      "translation": "Todos somos buenos y malos en\ncosas distintas. Tai conoce sus\npuntos fuertes y débiles, ¿no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "See, even I can be more of an\nadult sometimes!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22485,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "¿Ves? ¡Hasta yo puedo ser más\nmaduro a veces!"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Hm? What's this?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22532,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¿Hm? ¿Qué es esto?"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Is it safe to approach?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22549,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¿Es seguro acercarse?"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "It seems like it transfers you to\nanother space, like a warp point.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22573,
      "_bytes": 67,
      "translation": "Parece que te transporta a otro\nespacio, como un teletransporte."
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "I don't think it's dangerous per\nse, but if we use it carelessly,\nwe may get lost.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22641,
      "_bytes": 82,
      "translation": "No creo que sea peligroso en\nsí, pero si lo usamos sin\ncuidado, podríamos perdernos."
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "I guess we'll have to be careful.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22724,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "Habrá que tener cuidado."
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "There ought to be a map.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22758,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "Debería haber un mapa."
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "I guess we'll have to be careful\nabout going forward.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22783,
      "_bytes": 53,
      "translation": "Supongo que tendremos que ir\ncon cuidado al avanzar."
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Yes, we need to remember the\nlocations of the warp entry and\nexit points.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22837,
      "_bytes": 73,
      "translation": "Sí, debemos recordar las\nentradas y salidas de los\nteletransportes."
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "There ought to be a map with\nproper directions.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22911,
      "_bytes": 47,
      "translation": "Debería haber un mapa con\nlas indicaciones."
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "No, it's probably a puzzle to keep\nout thieves, so we'll have to\nmemorize all of the directions.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22959,
      "_bytes": 96,
      "translation": "No, seguro que es un acertijo\npara ahuyentar ladrones, así\nque habrá que memorizarlo todo."
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "So we've got no choice but to keep\ngoing, right?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23056,
      "_bytes": 48,
      "translation": "Así que no nos queda más que\nseguir adelante, ¿no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "It seems so.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23105,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "Eso parece."
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "This place is considerably\nstrange. The space here is\ndistorted and twisted.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23118,
      "_bytes": 76,
      "translation": "Este lugar es muy extraño.\nEl espacio aquí está\ndistorsionado y retorcido."
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "This world's weird enough, it\ndoesn't need this on top of it!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23195,
      "_bytes": 61,
      "translation": "¡Este mundo ya es raro de por\nsí, no necesitaba esto además!"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "There's something special about \nthis place. Is it because \nMyotismon's power is stronger here?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23257,
      "_bytes": 94,
      "translation": "Este lugar tiene algo especial.\n¿Será porque el poder de\nMyotismon es más fuerte aquí?"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Don't say things like that. It's\ntoo scary!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23352,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "No digas esas cosas. ¡Da\ndemasiado miedo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Anyway, let's keep going!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23396,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¡Bueno, sigamos adelante!"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "The time is nigh! We shall depart!",
      "speaker_id": 3031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23422,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "¡Ha llegado la hora! ¡Partimos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "Yes!",
      "speaker_id": 2831,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23457,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "¡Sí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Yes!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23462,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "¡Sí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Our objective is the eighth Chosen\nChild! Their corpse will be the\nbase of my grand ambitions!",
      "speaker_id": 3031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23467,
      "_bytes": 94,
      "translation": "¡Nuestro objetivo es el octavo\nNiño Elegido! ¡Su cadáver será\nla base de mis grandes planes!"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "Everything will be consumed by the\npower of darkness!",
      "speaker_id": 3031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23562,
      "_bytes": 53,
      "translation": "¡Todo será consumido por el\npoder de la oscuridad!"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "speaker_id": 6051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23616,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Sí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Tlon, Uqbar, Orbis Tertius!",
      "speaker_id": 3031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23622,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¡Tlon, Uqbar, Orbis Tertius!"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Now, we depart!",
      "speaker_id": 2831,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23650,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Ahora partimos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "Waaaaaaaaaaait! We won't let you\ndo that!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23666,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "¡Espeeeeeeeera! ¡No dejaremos\nque lo hagas!"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "So you're finally here...But\nyou're too late. Observe this\nhistoric moment!",
      "speaker_id": 3031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23708,
      "_bytes": 75,
      "translation": "Así que al fin llegáis...Pero\nes tarde. ¡Observad este\nmomento histórico!"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Don't mess with us!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23784,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡No te burles de nosotros!"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Unfortunately, I don't have the\ntime to deal with you.\nPicoDevimon!",
      "speaker_id": 3031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23804,
      "_bytes": 67,
      "translation": "Por desgracia no tengo tiempo\npara ocuparme de vosotros.\n¡DemiDevimon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Yes, sir!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23872,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Sí, señor!"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Wanna fight us again?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23882,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¿Peleamos otra vez?"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "This won't be like last time!\nNanimon, I'll leave 'em to you!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23904,
      "_bytes": 61,
      "translation": "¡Esta vez será distinto!\nNanimon, ¡te los dejo a ti!"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "Got it! You losers are in the way!\nGet out, you rascals!",
      "speaker_id": 4291,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23966,
      "_bytes": 56,
      "translation": "¡Entendido! ¡Estáis en medio,\nperdedores! ¡Fuera, granujas!"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "I surrender, I surrender!",
      "speaker_id": 4291,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24023,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¡Me rindo, me rindo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "Nanimon! You can't do that!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24049,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¡Nanimon! ¡Eso no se hace!"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "They say retreating is winning in\nits own way! Now, excuse meeeeeee!",
      "speaker_id": 4291,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24077,
      "_bytes": 68,
      "translation": "¡Dicen que retirarse también es\nganar! ¡Con permisoooooo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "So, what are you gonna do?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24146,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "Bueno, ¿qué vas a hacer?"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "S-so sneaky! There's so many of\nyou here...",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24173,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "¡Q-qué tramposos! Sois muchos\naquí..."
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "Come on, we don't have the time\nfor this. Let's take him down!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24217,
      "_bytes": 62,
      "translation": "Vamos, no tenemos tiempo para\nesto. ¡Acabemos con él!"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "I-I could say the same for you,\nI'll take *you* down!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24280,
      "_bytes": 53,
      "translation": "¡L-lo mismo digo, acabaré con\nvosotros!"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24334,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¡Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "english": "Hurry! The gate's closing!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24352,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¡Rápido, se cierra!"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "english": "We don't have time to play around!\nLet's go!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24379,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "¡No hay tiempo para tonterías!\n¡Vamos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "english": "Ugh, what an eyesore!",
      "speaker_id": 2831,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24424,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¡Uf, qué estorbo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "english": "!!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24446,
      "_bytes": 2,
      "translation": "!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "english": "Another little one. Shoo! Shoo!\nScram! You don't want to get hurt,\ndo you?",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24449,
      "_bytes": 74,
      "translation": "Otra cría. ¡Fuera! ¡Fuera!\n¡Largo! No querrás salir\nherida, ¿no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "english": "Don't make fun of me! Just watch!",
      "speaker_id": 2831,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24524,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "¡No te burles de mí! ¡Ya verás!"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "english": "Cat Kick! Cat Punch!",
      "speaker_id": 2831,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24558,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¡Patada! ¡Zarpazo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 6061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24579,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Aaaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "english": "She's stronger than she looks...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24590,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "Es más fuerte de lo que parece..."
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "english": "It's our turn now!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24623,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¡Ahora nos toca!"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "english": "Let's go!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24642,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Vamos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "english": "I'll have to stop you! Devidramon,\ngo!",
      "speaker_id": 2831,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24652,
      "_bytes": 38,
      "translation": "¡Os detendré! Devidramon,\n¡adelante!"
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "english": "Grooooooooooooah!",
      "speaker_id": 4906,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24691,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¡Grooooooooooooah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "english": "We did it!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24709,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Ya está!"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "english": "Hurry! Dive into the gate!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24720,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¡Rápido! ¡Saltad a la puerta!"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "english": "Okay, here I go!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24747,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¡Vale, allá voy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "english": "I can't let you do that!",
      "speaker_id": 2831,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24764,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "¡No te dejaré hacer eso!"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24789,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Aaaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "english": "Gyaaaaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24800,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¡Gyaaaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "english": "Noooooooooooo!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24813,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "¡Nooooooooooo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "english": "Bye-bye~!",
      "speaker_id": 2831,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24828,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Adióoos~!"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "english": "Aaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24838,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡Aaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "english": "No way!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24846,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡No puede ser!"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "english": "And we were so close...",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24854,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "Estábamos tan cerca..."
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "english": "No! At this rate, the eighth child\nis gonna...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24878,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "¡No! Así, el octavo niño va\na..."
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "english": "It's too much for us. Everyone,\nrun!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24925,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "Nos supera. ¡Corred todos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "english": "Come on! Tai...",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24962,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¡Vamos! Tai..."
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24981,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "english": "Tai...",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24985,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "Tai..."
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "english": "I see. That's a shame.",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24995,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "Ya veo. Qué pena."
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "english": "It's not just a \"shame\"! At this\npoint, the eighth child is doomed!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25018,
      "_bytes": 67,
      "translation": "¡No es solo \"una pena\"! ¡A este\npaso, el octavo niño está\nperdido!"
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "english": "Not just that, all those Digimon\nare gonna rampage throughout Japan \nand cause all sorts of chaos!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25086,
      "_bytes": 98,
      "translation": "¡Y no solo eso, esos Digimon van\na campar a sus anchas por Japón\ny causar todo tipo de caos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "english": "Hm...",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25185,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "Hm..."
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "english": "Isn't there another way to open\nthe gate?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25191,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "¿No hay otra forma de abrir\nla puerta?"
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "english": "There's another way, but...",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25233,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "Hay otra forma, pero..."
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "english": "Really?!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25261,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "¿Seguro?"
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "english": "Hm, but it's not easy to explain.",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25270,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "Hm, pero no es fácil de explicar."
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "english": "We don't have time to waste!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25304,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡No hay tiempo que perder!"
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "english": "All right, then. Why don't you\ncome to my place?",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25333,
      "_bytes": 48,
      "translation": "Muy bien, entonces. ¿Por qué no\nvenís a mi casa?"
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "english": "Your place?",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25382,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¿Tu casa?"
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "english": "Take a look behind you.",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25394,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "Mirad atrás."
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "english": "!!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25418,
      "_bytes": 2,
      "translation": "!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "english": "Ah! Over there!",
      "speaker_id": 2721,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25421,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Ah! ¡Ahí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "english": "If you follow that light, you'll\narrive at my place.",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25437,
      "_bytes": 52,
      "translation": "Si seguís esa luz, llegaréis\na mi casa."
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "english": "Got it!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25490,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡Vale!"
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "english": "Then I'll be waiting for you.",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 25498,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "Entonces os estaré esperando."
    }
  ]
}